Usage: az issue <list|search|get|claim|takeover|release|events|record|context-risk|get-many|check|doctor|create|split|update|close|delete|unarchive|image|document|dep|bulk-create|bulk-update|fanout> [arguments]

Commands:
  list [--project <project-id>] [--json] [--deps] [--query <text>|-q <text>] [--created-after YYYY-MM-DD] [--created-before YYYY-MM-DD] [--updated-after YYYY-MM-DD] [--updated-before YYYY-MM-DD] [--status <status> ...] [--statuses a,b,c] [--limit N] [--id <id> ...] [--ids a,b,c] [--parent <id> ...] [--parents a,b,c] [--depends-on <id> ...] [--depends-on-ids a,b,c]  List issues from daemon-backed store
  search [--project <project-id>] [--json] [--deps] [--created-after YYYY-MM-DD] [--created-before YYYY-MM-DD] [--updated-after YYYY-MM-DD] [--updated-before YYYY-MM-DD] [--status <status> ...] [--statuses a,b,c] [--limit N] [--id <id> ...] [--ids a,b,c] [--parent <id> ...] [--parents a,b,c] [--depends-on <id> ...] [--depends-on-ids a,b,c] (--query <text>|-q <text>|<query>)  Search title, description, notes, design, acceptance, labels, and implementations
  get [--project <project-id>] [--id <issue-id>] [--json] [--with-notes] [<issue-id>]  Show a single issue by ID
  claim [--project <project-id>] [--id <issue-id>] [--owner <owner-id>] [--kind human|agent|orchestrator] [--ttl 2h] [--force] [--json] [<issue-id>]  Claim an issue ownership lease
  takeover [--project <project-id>] [--id <issue-id>] [--owner <owner-id>] [--kind human|agent|orchestrator] [--ttl 2h] [--json] [<issue-id>]  Force-claim an issue ownership lease
  release [--project <project-id>] [--id <issue-id>] [--owner <owner-id>] [--force] [--json] [<issue-id>]  Release an issue ownership lease
  events [--project <project-id>] [--id <issue-id>] [--json] [--type <event-type> ...] [--types a,b] [--limit N] [<issue-id>]  List an issue's durable observation event stream
  record [--project <project-id>] [--id <issue-id>] [--type <event-type>] [--summary <text>] [--body <text>] [--data <json-object>] [--follow-up <issue-id> ...] [--json] [<issue-id>]  Append durable issue activity/evidence without mailbox delivery
  context-risk [--project <project-id>] [--id <issue-id>] [--since 14d] [--summary|--full] [--json] [<issue-id>]  Show compact repeated local failure/overlap risk context
  get-many [--project <project-id>] --id <issue-id> [--id <issue-id> ...] [--ids a,b,c] [--json] [--with-notes]  Fetch many issues in requested order
  check [--project <project-id>] [--id <issue-id>] [--json] [<issue-id>]  Alias for get
  doctor [--project <project-id>] [--id <issue-id>] [--json] [<issue-id>]  Run integrity checks for one issue
  create [--project <project-id>] [--parent <issue-id>] [--impl <implementation> ...] [--deferred] [--type ...] [--priority ...] [--description ...] [--json] <title>  Create an issue; auto-parents to AZEDARACH_ISSUE_ID when set
  split [--project <project-id>] [--parent <issue-id>] [--impl <implementation> ...] [--type ...] [--priority ...] [--description ...] [--json] <title>  Create a child issue and launch it with az orchestrate start
  update [--project <project-id>] [--id <issue-id>] [--json] [<issue-id>] [--title ...] [--description ...] [--notes ...] [--append-notes ...] [--status ...] [--force-worktree] [--type ...] [--priority ...] [--update-impl <impl> ...]  Update issue fields (`--status closed` integrates, cleans, then closes)
  close [--project <project-id>] [--id <issue-id>|-i <issue-id>] [--json] [--force-worktree] [<issue-id>]  Integrate, clean up, and close an issue
  delete [--project <project-id>] [--id <issue-id>] [--json] [<issue-id>] --confirm [--cleanup|--stop-session] [--remove-worktree] [--force-worktree]  Permanently delete an issue
  unarchive [--project <project-id>] [--id <issue-id>] [--json] [--with-parents] [--cascade-children] [<issue-id>]  Restore archived issues to active reads
  image add [--project <project-id>] [--issue-id <issue-id>] [--path <file>] [<issue-id> <file>] [--json]  Attach an image to an issue
  image remove [--project <project-id>] [--issue-id <issue-id>] [--attachment-id <attachment-id>] [<issue-id> <attachment-id>] [--json]  Remove an image attachment from an issue
  document add [--project <project-id>] [--issue-id <issue-id>] [--path <file>] [<issue-id> <file>] [--json]  Attach a report/document to an issue
  document list [--project <project-id>] [--issue-id <issue-id>] [<issue-id>] [--json]  List report/document attachments for an issue
  document remove [--project <project-id>] [--issue-id <issue-id>] [--attachment-id <attachment-id>] [<issue-id> <attachment-id>] [--json]  Remove a document attachment from an issue
  dep add [--project <project-id>] [--issue-id <issue-id>] [--depends-on-id <depends-on-id>] [--type blocks|related|parent-child|discovered-from|created-in] [--force-parent-change] [--json]  Add a dependency edge
  dep remove [--project <project-id>] [--issue-id <issue-id>] [--depends-on-id <depends-on-id>] [--type blocks|related|parent-child|discovered-from|created-in] [--confirm] [--confirm-parent-orphan] [--json]  Remove a dependency edge
  dep bulk apply [--project <project-id>] --input <path> [--dry-run] [--json]  Apply dependency edge mutations
  bulk-create [--project <project-id>] [--impl <implementation>] --input <path> [--dry-run] [--json]  Create issues, epics, or nested children trees from JSON
  bulk-update [--project <project-id>] [--impl <implementation>] --input <path> [--dry-run] [--json]  Execute bulk update operations
  fanout [--project <project-id>] --input <path> [--apply] [--json]  Plan/apply a pre-authored nested issue tree from JSON
  fanout ready [--project <project-id>] --root <issue-id> [--json]  List runnable leaf issues under a fanout root
  fanout drift [--project <project-id>] --issue <issue-id> [--worktree <path>] [--json] [--fail-on-out]  Advisory ownership drift diagnostics

Status semantics:
  open         Not yet active
  in_progress Active work
  in_review   Complete and waiting for review/integration
  closed      Accepted/integrated and complete
  Blocked work is represented with `dep add --type blocks`, not a status.
  Agent progress, validation, review facts, and worker closeout belong in mail/observation evidence, not issue notes.

Graph/root membership:
  To create a child under the active issue, run `az issue create "Child task"` from a session with AZEDARACH_ISSUE_ID set.
  To attach to a different parent/root at creation time, pass `--parent <issue-id>`.
  Child/root membership comes from AZEDARACH_ISSUE_ID auto-parenting, `--parent`, or `dep add --type parent-child`.
  Do not use `--impl <id>` when you mean "parent this under <id>".
  `--impl` assigns implementation/spec variant metadata only; it never attaches an issue to a graph/root.

Argument ordering: place flags/options before positional arguments for deterministic parsing.
